# Forward A3 recording: chronological slot 2 writes source step 6 (zero-based 5).
wait 300
tapkey w0
tap SEQ
turn SELECT 1
turn K3 2
turn K4 1
tap EDIT
tap REC
tap PLAY
turn K1 1 80
expect sound0.0.0 35
wait 20
expect laneval0.0.0.5 35
expect laneval0.0.0.1 255
wait 2000
tap PLAY
expect laneval0.0.0.5 35
